=You are a senior B2B sales copywriter. Write a personalized outbound sales email based strictly on the lead intelligence below.

LEAD:
Name: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.fullName }}
Company: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.company }}
Job Title: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.jobTitle }}
Website: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.website }}
Country: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.country }}
Original Message: {{ $('Normalize Lead Data').item.json.message }}

AI LEAD INTELLIGENCE:
Lead Score: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.leadScore }}/100
Temperature: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.temperature }}
Industry: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.industry }}
Company Size: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.companySize }}
Business Type: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.businessType }}
Intent: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.intent }}
Estimated Deal Value: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.estimatedDealValue }}
Company Summary: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.companySummary }}
Buying Signals: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.buyingSignals }}
Potential Objections: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.potentialObjections }}
Recommended Action: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.recommendedAction }}
Proposal Angle: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.proposalAngle }}
Personalized Opener: {{ $('Parse & Validate AI Output').item.json.personalizedOpener }}

REQUIREMENTS:
- Write a professional, concise, conversion-focused B2B email.
- Personalize it using the actual lead and company information above.
- Address the lead's stated need or intent when available.
- Use the buying signals and proposal angle to shape the value proposition.
- Account for potential objections naturally.
- Do not invent facts that are not present in the provided data.
- Use a clear, low-friction CTA.
- Maximum 200 words.
- Never use "I hope this email finds you well".
- No emojis.

Return ONLY a valid JSON object in exactly this structure:
{
  "subject": "Email subject line, maximum 60 characters",
  "body": "Complete email body using \\n for line breaks. Sign off as: [Your Name]\\nAI Automation Specialist"
}

